@step Verify the spreadsheet calculation for the modelo, year, and period.
@static aeat app modelo spreadsheet verify --modelo 303 --year 2026 --period 1T
@blocked external-service Refuses with no registered Google OAuth client; consent cannot be granted here.
@step Verify against an explicit scenario JSON of inputs and expected outputs.
@static aeat app modelo spreadsheet verify --modelo 303 --year 2026 --period 1T --scenario ./scenario.json
@blocked external-service Needs a Google OAuth consent and a live Sheets API the sandbox has no credentials for.
